OL,3,GNEWSAOver 50 houses empty for decades
OL,4,Ato be revamped
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 50 houses that have been
OL,7,Fempty and derelict for about 20 years
OL,8,Fare to be refurbished.
OL,10,FThe properties, across the Anfield,
OL,11,FEverton, Edge Hill and Princes Park
OL,12,Fareas of Liverpool, will need extensive
OL,13,Frepairs before they are habitable
OL,14,Fagain.
OL,16,FLiverpool City Council said people on
OL,17,Fthe city's housing waiting list would
OL,18,Fbe able to live in some of the houses
OL,19,Fonce they were refurbished.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
