OL,4,Ato be revamped
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cabinet member for housing, Hetty
OL,7,FWood, said: "We are determined to bring
OL,8,Fempty homes back into use and make the
OL,9,Fmost of the housing we already have
OL,10,Facross the city."
